# Felwood - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Felwood accept in the local census (59 quests,
# docs/felwood-census.md) appears exactly once as an accept; 59
# turnins close every record that has one in the data. The 38
# repeatables (corrupted-plant turn-ins, the Salve even-numbered
# follow-ups, Timbermaw/Winterfall feather-and-bead turn-ins), the 7
# min60 endgame class quests (Warlock dreadsteed links, Hunter ancient
# bow chain), and the 4 accepts-elsewhere records (Stormwind 84397,
# Darkshore 994/995/5713) are out with reasons in the census; 21 Horde
# quests are set aside by ID for the Horde block. No race header and no
# race gates: nothing contracted is race-locked. Class gates: the
# Niby/Impsy lines are Warlock-only (7601/7602/7603/8420/8421/8422) and
# 81790 is Paladin-only. Profession lines ride optional + when-skill
# gates. Ungateable outside pres (3942 Un'Goro for 4084, 5084
# Winterspring for 5085, 5159 Barrens for 5165) are contracted with
# honest notes and reported as structural warnings, not silently
# dropped. The 5250 Starfall variant accepts in Teldrassil and stays
# out; the Stormwind variant 8419 stays home while the Felwood leg
# 8420 is contracted chain-consistent.

guide butler-routes-completionist/felwood
title Felwood - Completionist
levels 45-55
zone Felwood
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Emerald Sanctuary - arrival and the Eridan hub

  zone map 1448

  accept 4421 only Alliance -- The Corruption of the Jadefire - Eridan Bluewind; the Jadefire Run opens
  tip Emerald Sanctuary is the hub: Eridan Bluewind (51.35,81.51), Greta Mosshoof (51.21,82.11), Taronn Redfeather (50.89,81.62), Ivy Leafrunner (50.96,81.58) and Jessir Moonbow (51.35,82.01) all live here. 4084 Silver Heart and 4005 Aquementas need 3942 Linken's Memory (Un'Goro, contracted nowhere) done first - the Un'Goro leg below unlocks them. 4441 Felbound Ancients needs the Flute quest 939 done first - hunt Xavaric in the north run below.
  tip Eridan also holds a Tailoring writ - the dedicated writ step below carries it.

step Emerald Sanctuary - Greta, Taronn, Ivy and the west briefing

  zone map 1448

  accept 5155 -- Forces of Jaedenar - Greta Mosshoof; the Shadow Hold offensive
  accept 91952 -- The Source of the Corruption - Greta Mosshoof; a delivery for Ketharas in Mount Hyjal (far expedition below)
  tip Greta, Taronn, Ivy and Jessir also hold profession writs - the dedicated writ steps below carry them.
  accept 5156 -- Verifying the Corruption - Taronn Redfeather; Entropics and craters in Shatter Scar Vale

  accept 5249 only Alliance -- To Winterspring! - Ivy Leafrunner; a delivery for Wynd Nightchaser in Winterspring (expedition below, and note 5250 Starfall is the Teldrassil-accepting twin - not contracted here)


  accept 86577 -- A Sampling of Putrescence - Kelek Skykeeper; organs off Felwood bears and wolves (Deadwood south below)
  tip 5158 Seeking Spiritual Aid opens after 5157's turn-in below, and 5165 Dousing the Flames needs 5159 Cleansed Water (accepts in the Barrens, contracted nowhere) done first - the Barrens leg below unlocks it; until then the braziers wait.

step Emerald Sanctuary - Arathandris and the Salve line

  zone map 1448

  accept 4101 only Alliance -- Cleansing Felwood - Arathandris Silversky; Blood Amber off the Warpwood, east
  tip Turning in 4101 unlocks the one-time Salve feeders 5882 (hunting, open) and 5883/5884/5885/5886 (Mining/Herbalism/Skinning/Enchanting, optional + profession-gated); their repeatable even-numbered follow-ups are OUT of contract - the one-time feeders above are the whole chain here.

